w":"本次实训围绕智睿政务问卷调查系统的部署、局域网管理、VPN远程接入和页面性能测试展开。原有实验完成了虚拟机、IIS","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10181,"paragraph_id":"00000113","paragraph_index":219,"start_index":10116,"text_preview":"针对评审意见，修订稿补充了RRAS/PPTP VPN配置与验证标准，并将局域网管理扩展到地址、账户权限、防火墙、日志和备份等","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10195,"paragraph_id":"00000114","paragraph_index":220,"start_index":10182,"text_preview":"1. 环境搭建与局域网管理","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10333,"paragraph_id":"00000115","paragraph_index":221,"start_index":10196,"text_preview":"虚拟机与物理主机应处于同一网段，服务器固定地址需要通过DHCP保留或地址排除避免冲突。除ping和网页访问外，还应结","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10347,"paragraph_id":"00000116","paragraph_index":222,"start_index":10334,"text_preview":"2. IIS配置与故障排查","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10400,"paragraph_id":"00000117","paragraph_index":223,"start_index":10348,"text_preview":"Windows Server 2003的IIS 6.0与后续版本有较大差异，配置和排错时应注意以下要点：","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10450,"paragraph_id":"00000118","paragraph_index":224,"start_index":10401,"text_preview":"必须在“Web服务扩展”中允许“Active Server Pages”，并按程序需要启用父路径。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10492,"paragraph_id":"00000119","paragraph_index":225,"start_index":10451,"text_preview":"出现HTTP 401.3时，应重点检查网站目录ACL、匿名访问账户和NTFS权限。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10521,"paragraph_id":"0000011A","paragraph_index":226,"start_index":10493,"text_preview":"需将index.asp设为默认文档，并在修改后重新测试。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10536,"paragraph_id":"0000011B","paragraph_index":227,"start_index":10522,"text_preview":"3. VPN与公网发布的区别","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10708,"paragraph_id":"0000011C","paragraph_index":228,"start_index":10537,"text_preview":"RRAS/PPTP实验包含服务启用、地址池、专用账户拨入权限、MS-CHAP v2、MPPE加密、客户端PPP地址和会话检查，构成完整的VPN配","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10718,"paragraph_id":"0000011D","paragraph_index":229,"start_index":10709,"text_preview":"4. 性能结果分析","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10895,"paragraph_id":"0000011E","paragraph_index":230,"start_index":10719,"text_preview":"两次DebugBear结果中，TTFB由421 ms降至384 ms，FCP和LCP均由1.81 s降至1.76 s，实验室得分由98%升至99%。这些结果说明本次重测表现","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10908,"paragraph_id":"0000011F","paragraph_index":231,"start_index":10896,"text_preview":"5. 实训不足与改进方向","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":11033,"paragraph_index":232,"start_index":10909,"text_preview":"Windows Server 2003和PPTP均已过时，本实验只适合隔离环境；DebugBear属于页面性能测试，并不等同于并发压力测试。后续可增","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":11101,"paragraph_index":233,"start_index":11034,"text_preview":"通过本次修订，我进一步区分了网站发布、内网穿透、VPN和局域网管理的职责边界，也认识到实训报告必须使配置步骤、","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":11106,"paragraph_id":"00000120","paragraph_index":234,"start_index":11102,"text_preview":"参考资料","type":"Title"},{"end_index":11171,"paragraph_id":"00000121","paragraph_index":235,"start_index":11107,"text_preview":"[1] 佚名. 智睿政务问卷调查系统 v10.9.6[EB/OL]. https://asp300.cn/44344.html.","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":11292,"paragraph_id":"00000122","paragraph_index":236,"start_index":11172,"text_preview":"[2] DebugBear. Page Speed Report——智睿政务问卷调查系统（初测）[EB/OL]. https://www.debugbear.com/test/website-speed/6sGDL7bB/overview.","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":11413,"paragraph_id":"00000123","paragraph_index":237,"start_index":11293,"text_preview":"[3] DebugBear. Page Speed Report——智睿政务问卷调查系统（重测）[EB/OL]. https://www.debugbear.com/test/website-speed/AYH3Im3v/overview.","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":11505,"paragraph_id":"00000124","paragraph_index":238,"start_index":11414,"text_preview":"[4] DebugBear. Why Use DebugBear?[EB/OL]. https://www.debugbear.com/docs/why-use-debugbear.","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":11553,"paragraph_id":"00000125","paragraph_index":239,"start_index":11506,"text_preview":"[5] 国家开放大学网络管理课程组. 网络系统管理与维护[M]. 北京: 国家开放大学出版社.","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":11588,"paragraph_id":"00000126","paragraph_index":240,"start_index":11554,"text_preview":"[6] 周昌令. 网络安全技术[M]. 北京: 国家开放大学出版社.","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":11832,"paragraph_index":241,"start_index":11589,"text_preview":"[7] ngrok. ngrok Documentation[EB/OL]. https://ngrok.com/docs.[8] Microsoft. VPN remote access for employees: Windows Server 2003[EB/OL]. https://learn.microsof","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":12018,"paragraph_index":242,"start_index":11833,"text_preview":"[9] Microsoft. Virtual Private Network Connections: Windows Server 2003[EB/OL]. https://learn.microsoft.com/zh-cn/previous-versions/windows/it-pro/windows-serve","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":12019,"paragraph_id":"00000127","paragraph_index":243,"start_index":12019,"type":"Paragraph"}],"numbering_list_summaries":[{"num_id":"ju3due","numbering_items":[{"level":1,"paragraph_index":44,"text_preview":"支持单选/多选一体化功能，满足多样化问卷设计需求；"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":45,"text_preview":"提供图形化模块比例显示，直观展示调查结果；"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":46,"text_preview":"支持问卷开关控制，灵活管理问卷发布状态；"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":47,"text_preview":"具备安全防SQL注入机制，保障数据安全；"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":48,"text_preview":"支持IP审核功能，防止刷票行为；"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":49,"text_preview":"内置问卷咨询及在线回复管理功能；"},{"level":1,"paragraph_index":50,"text_preview":"支持多权限后台管理，便于分级操作。"}],"numbering_type":"decimal"},{"num_id":"npz74d","numbering_items":[{"level":1,"paragraph_index":53,"text_preview":"搭建测试环境。本步骤包括以下过程："}],"numbering_type":"decimal"},{"num_id":"npz74d","numbering_items":[{"level":1,"paragraph_index":58,"text_preview":"测试与分析。对网站页面进行性能测试，对测试结果进行分析，并尝试改变虚拟机配置，重新测试，考察不同配置对网站"}],"numbering_type":"decimal"},{"num_id":"4ikhf1","numbering_items":[{"level":1,"paragraph_index":77,"text_preview":"在VMware Workstation 16 Pro中打开虚拟机设置对话框，将网络适配器设置为桥接模式："}],"numbering_type":"decimal"},{"num_id":"4ikhf1","numbering_items":[{"level":1,"paragraph_index":80,"text_preview":"为考察不同的网络环境对网站性能的影响，随后单击“高级”按钮，在网络适配器高级设置对话框中，将传出传输的带宽"}],"numbering_type":"decimal"},{"num_id":"l00rqr","numbering_items":[{"level":1,"paragraph_index":84,"text_preview":"随后开启虚拟机，安装IIS。因本网站使用ASP编写，故选择要安装的Windows组件时，勾选了“Internet信息服务（IIS）”中的“"}],"numbering_type":"decimal"},{"num_id":"l00rqr","numbering_items":[{"level":1,"paragrap